Z||000050||Ken Wittlief||05-29-2001||08:26 AM||||You can prove the Philidelphia Experiment never took place. There were many mechanics and engineers on the ship when it was being constructed who were stationed on the ship the whole time it was in active duty during the war.<P>It was a common practice - they were the ones that had to keep the ship running during operation so they were a part of the construction team.<P>  Several of these men are still alive.<P> They were always present on the ship, so there never was a special crew put on board and secret experiments done.<P>  The eye witness accounts of several men is proof. The whole Philidelphia Experiment story was made up by a guy (Sancheze?!) who was mentally ill. The ship BTW is still being used in Greece.||||reg||2
